# Source of truth for dev/test tooling.
#
# requirements.txt is the generated, fully pinned lock used by CI and local
# installs. Regenerate it after editing this file:
#
#   uv pip compile requirements.in --universal --python-version 3.12 -o requirements.txt
#
# Pinned pins keep OSV dependency scans fast (no transitive resolution) and
# reproducible across macOS and Linux runners.
